WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.110
About two hundred and forty people, seven surnames, and land that cannot be sold.

00:00:06.210 --> 00:00:09.250
Edinburgh of the Seven Seas is the only settlement.

00:00:09.250 --> 00:00:12.290
Land is held in common, and no outsider may buy it.

00:00:12.290 --> 00:00:15.450
Families farm potatoes in an area called the Patches,

00:00:15.450 --> 00:00:18.192
and keep cattle and sheep under strict quotas.

00:00:19.292 --> 00:00:21.750
The economy rests on the Tristan rock lobster,

00:00:21.750 --> 00:00:24.423
fished from longboats and processed on the island.

00:00:25.523 --> 00:00:30.354
A tiny founding population has made Tristan a classic subject for genetics.

00:00:30.354 --> 00:00:34.155
Researchers have studied the unusually high rate of asthma,

00:00:34.155 --> 00:00:37.762
and matched family trees going back to 1816 against DNA.

00:00:37.762 --> 00:00:43.108
That raises Baldacchino's question sharply: what does a community gain, or give up,

00:00:43.108 --> 00:00:44.912
by becoming a research site?
